      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "WHERE WE OPERATE",
        "statement": "Most of this category sells pleasure.\nWe design <strong>the part before it</strong>.",
        "support": "<p>There is a gap between being willing and actually wanting to. It opens up somewhere between the sofa and the bedroom, on an ordinary Tuesday, in a relationship that is perfectly fine.</p><p>Everything we make is built for that gap — small, easy ways back to each other that ask nothing of you but an evening.</p>",
